    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About &amp; privacy</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">SortSnap works 100% on your device.\n\n• It has no internet permission, so it physically cannot upload anything.\n• No analytics, no ads, no accounts.\n• Sorting uses on-device ML Kit models bundled inside the app.\n• Your corrections and learned rules are stored only in the app\'s private storage and are excluded from cloud backup.\n• Deleting always goes through Android\'s own confirmation, and on Android 11+ items go to the system trash first.</string>

